        <mxCell id="v14-schema-note" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Medicare local SQLite database — Schema version 15&#xA;Business IDs and foreign keys are INTEGER and match Firestore IDs; existing IDs stay unchanged.&#xA;Firebase Authentication UIDs remain TEXT; MedicationAction.patientId references patients.patient_id.&#xA;Reference tables, cloud_id_maps and reserved_record_ids are local only. New integer IDs work offline; Firestore lookups use existing clinical records." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;">
